{"id":"905868da4e6087cf","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-separation-in-system.md","title":"Separation and Exact Separation in a System","display":"df-separation-in-system — Separation and Exact Separation in a System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-separation-in-system","aliases":["92-df-separation-in-system"],"display":"df-separation-in-system — Separation and Exact Separation in a System","source":"第 VI 章 p. 77；第 VII 章 pp. 86、90（PDF 94、103、107）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-representability]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-separation-in-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-separation-in-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-separation-in-system — Separation and Exact Separation in a System"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VI 章 p. 77；第 VII 章 pp. 86、90（PDF 94、103、107）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9758d74f9a5e939a\" href=\"?note=9758d74f9a5e939a\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-representability\">92-df-smullyan-representability</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,D\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\">\\(C,D\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1\">\\(\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^1\">\\(\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^1\\)</span> 分别是实例操作及原书普通表示关系。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sep}_{\\mathcal S}^k,\\mathrm{Sep}_{\\mathcal S},\\mathrm{ExactSep}_{\\mathcal S}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sep}_{\\mathcal S}^k,\\mathrm{Sep}_{\\mathcal S},\\mathrm{ExactSep}_{\\mathcal S}\\)</span> 是下文定义的公式与有序集合对之间的三元谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(K\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G(K)\\subseteq\\{v_i\\mid i&lt;k\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G(K)\\subseteq\\{v_i\\mid i&lt;k\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k\">\\(\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k\\)</span> 为相应元数的无捕获实例。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}separation\\text{-}in\\text{-}system}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Sep}_{\\mathcal S}^k(K;C,D)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\\forall\\vec n\\in C\\;\\mathcal S\\vdash\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k(K;\\overline{\\vec n})\\Bigr]\n\\land\\Bigl[\\forall\\vec n\\in D\\;\\mathcal S\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k(K;\\overline{\\vec n})\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sep}_{\\mathcal S}(F;A,B)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Sep}_{\\mathcal S}^1(F;A,B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ExactSep}_{\\mathcal S}(F;A,B)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^1(F,A)\\land\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^1(\\neg F,B).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}separation\\text{-}in\\text{-}system}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Sep}_{\\mathcal S}^k(K;C,D)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\\forall\\vec n\\in C\\;\\mathcal S\\vdash\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k(K;\\overline{\\vec n})\\Bigr]\n\\land\\Bigl[\\forall\\vec n\\in D\\;\\mathcal S\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k(K;\\overline{\\vec n})\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sep}_{\\mathcal S}(F;A,B)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Sep}_{\\mathcal S}^1(F;A,B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ExactSep}_{\\mathcal S}(F;A,B)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^1(F,A)\\land\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^1(\\neg F,B).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>普通分离对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\setminus(A\\cup B)\">\\(\\mathbb N\\setminus(A\\cup B)\\)</span> 不作判定要求；精确分离还要求这些数的实例既不可证也不可反驳。在一致系统中，分离 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的公式所表示的集合是包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>、且与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 不交的集合。这是原书 Rosser 路线的核心，而非关于证明码大小的谓词定义本身。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VI 章 p. 77；第 VII 章 pp. 86、90（PDF 94、103、107）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-representability","status":"resolved","id":"9758d74f9a5e939a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-representability]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"k\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"C,D\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sep}_{\\mathcal S}^k,\\mathrm{Sep}_{\\mathcal S},\\mathrm{ExactSep}_{\\mathcal S}","display":false},{"tex":"K\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G(K)\\subseteq\\{v_i\\mid i<k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}separation\\text{-}in\\text{-}system}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Sep}_{\\mathcal S}^k(K;C,D)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\\forall\\vec n\\in C\\;\\mathcal S\\vdash\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k(K;\\overline{\\vec n})\\Bigr]\n\\land\\Bigl[\\forall\\vec n\\in D\\;\\mathcal S\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k(K;\\overline{\\vec n})\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sep}_{\\mathcal S}(F;A,B)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Sep}_{\\mathcal S}^1(F;A,B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ExactSep}_{\\mathcal S}(F;A,B)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^1(F,A)\\land\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^1(\\neg F,B).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb N\\setminus(A\\cup B)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false}],"bytes":2153,"backlinks":[{"id":"6e0988554a7f9a4b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8d06776406d2e58e","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"00f528e893a47b3f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"521018a78a163e38","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"64779d4d642bf6b2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-68","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-separation-in-system]] → [[92-df-smullyan-rosser-system]]；[[92-df-finite-order-system]] → [[92-lem-rosser-separation]]给出证明序的分离机制。Rosser 系统需分离 $A\\setminus B$ 与 $B\\setminus A$。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-97","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-separation-in-system]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-157","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-separation-in-system]]"}],"outgoing":["9758d74f9a5e939a"]}